              "type": "single",
              "question": "用计算器计算 12345679 × 9 = 111111111，那么 12345679 × 18 = （　　）。",
              "options": [
                "A. 222222222",
                "B. 333333333",
                "C. 111111111",
                "D. 444444444"
              ],
              "answer": "A",
              "explanation": "18是9的2倍，所以 12345679 × 18 = 12345679 × 9 × 2 = 111111111 × 2 = 222222222。",
              "knowledgePointIds": [
                "unit-math-4-up-rjb-p3::kp-num-007"
              ],
              "metadata": {
                "difficulty": "提高"
              }
            },
